3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-d53266320eaca603END_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-46e64c97e07ff552END_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">QUEST_NoteFromOrin</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:QUEST_NoteFromOrin\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:QUEST_NoteFromOrin\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">ffc6092a-58a1-4446-a226-84456e87f79b</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:ffc6092a-58a1-4446-a226-84456e87f79b\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:ffc6092a-58a1-4446-a226-84456e87f79b\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Carried by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dolor\" title=\"Dolor\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f6/Portrait_Dolor.png/25px-Portrait_Dolor.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f6/Portrait_Dolor.png/38px-Portrait_Dolor.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f6/Portrait_Dolor.png/50px-Portrait_Dolor.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Dolor\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f6/Portrait_Dolor.png/25px-Portrait_Dolor.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f6/Portrait_Dolor.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dolor\" title=\"Dolor\">Dolor</a></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>[The following text is printed haphazardly on a torn, bloody page titled 'Dirge of The Unholy Assassin]\n</p><p><br>\n<i>'Neath <a href=\"/wiki/Candulhallow%27s_Tombstones\" title=\"Candulhallow's Tombstones\">Candulhallow's quiet tombs</a>\n</i></p><p><i>Lies a path to murder's boons.\n</i></p><p><i>If entry <a href=\"/wiki/Murder_Tribunal\" title=\"Murder Tribunal\">down below's</a> your aim\n</i></p><p><i>seek trigger hidden by a frame\n</i></p><p><i>'Sicarius' the door awaits\n</i></p><p><i>To admit those who seek their fates.\n</i></p><p><i><br>\nIf to continue you insist\n</i></p><p><i>Show a trophy rent from wrist\n</i></p><p><i>Of sacrifice for our <a href=\"/wiki/Bhaal\" title=\"Bhaal\">lord</a> planned\n</i></p><p><i>Present death's knight a bloodied -</i>\n</p><p><br>\n[A smear of blood obscures the poem's final word.]\n</p>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>After reading, the name of this note changes from \"Torn and Bloody Page\" to \"Dirge of the Unholy Assassin\".</li>\n<li>The reading party member says <i>\"A passphrase, 'Sicarius', and a location... We should find this 'Candulhallow' place.\"</i> out loud after reading the note.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714200853\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.054 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.056 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1727/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 28857/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 8794/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.010/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 931039/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   44.386      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   44.386      1 -total\n 47.23%   20.964      7 Template:Icon_text\n 41.99%   18.636     20 Template:Trim\n 20.83%    9.245      2 Template:Uid\n 14.70%    6.525      1 Template:PageSeo\n 14.44%    6.409      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 14.36%    6.374      1 Template:Main_only\n 12.28%    5.450      2 Template:Template_style\n 11.67%    5.179      2 Template:Icon_link\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:22270-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714200853 and revision id 348971. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}